# ── PartyKit ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Production URL of your PartyKit server.
# 1. Run: npx partykit deploy (login via GitHub if prompted)
# 2. Copy the URL: https://your-project-name.your-github-username.partykit.dev
# 3. Set it here (without https:// prefix)
#
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT: Vite bakes PUBLIC_* env vars at BUILD TIME, not runtime.
#    This file is just a template — you must set the variable during build:
#
#      PUBLIC_PARTYKIT_HOST=gaple-party.johndoe.partykit.dev npm run build
#
#    Or add it to your deployment platform's build-time environment variables.
#
# Example: gaple-party.johndoe.partykit.dev
PUBLIC_PARTYKIT_HOST=
